   "JobDescription": "<p>Green University of Bangladesh is one of the leading universities in the private sector. We are looking for an IT Officer for the Green University Center for IT Services (GCITS). We encourage individuals who are dedicated to working and building a career in academic administration.</p><p><strong>Job Responsibilites:</strong></p><ul><li><p><span style=\"color:black;\">Provide regular IT support to students, faculty, and administrative staff.</span></p></li><li><p><span style=\"color:black;\">Perform device servicing and repairs for computers, printers, and other IT equipment.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Assist in the installation and configuration of software and hardware.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Collaborate with the IT team to ensure efficient IT operations.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Provide technical assistance to end-users and resolve IT-related issues.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Keep records of service requests and maintenance activities.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Manage and maintain the CCTV surveillance system across the university campus. (CCTV, Intercom, and User Support).</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Oversee the intercom and sound system operations, ensuring they are functioning correctly.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Provide necessary IT support at the General Computer Lab</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Troubleshoot and resolve IT-related problems reported by users.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Keep records of CCTV footage and system maintenance activities.</span></p></li><li><p style=\"text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:black;\">Maintain and troubleshoot Point of Sale (POS) machines in the university canteen.</span></p></li></ul>",
   "JobNature": "Full Time",
   "JobWorkPlace": "Work at office",
   "EducationRequirements": "<ul><li>Minimum Bachelor’s Degree in CSE or others relevant field with a CGPA of 3.00 out of 4.00</li><li>Minimum GPA 4.00 out of 5.00 in SSC &amp; HSC or equivalent.</li></ul>",
